# Who may read (subscribe) and write (publish) which MQTT topics. Anything not listed is denied.

# The controller: publishes its data and receives commands under wildnis/
user climacontrol
topic readwrite wildnis/#

# Data collector: read only, so it can never send a command
user telegraf
topic read wildnis/#

# Manual tests: may read and send commands
user tester
topic readwrite wildnis/#
